      "side": 1,
      "message": "The `scanner.monitor_handle` stores the handle of the pattern monitor. So, I think we shouldn\u0027t overwrite it with the child address monitor handle.\n\nAlso, there could be more than one address monitors for one pattern monitor, and `scanner.monitor_handle` won\u0027t be updated every time a child address monitor is removed when the device is lost.\n\nSo, let\u0027s store address monitor handles only in `scanner.monitor_handle_map`",
